error BYN3002: arena `arena` does not live as long as `b`, which borrows it

  14 │         m[1] = v
     │                - `put` stores `v` into `this` here
     │
  22 │         b.put(mk2("ann", from: arena))
     │         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ arena `arena` is freed at the end of its block
     │
  help: copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough
